    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Belle, jeune et pleine de doutes, Mavie cherche sa voie. Elle arrive \u00e0 Paris et y rencontre Georges, libraire au Quartier Latin depuis quarante ans. Solitaire, comme cach\u00e9 dans sa boutique o\u00f9 personne ne vient, Georges l\u2019intrigue et la fascine. Aussi improbable qu\u2019inattendue, leur histoire d\u2019amour va d\u00e9finitivement transformer le destin de ces deux dr\u00f4les d\u2019oiseaux.",
        "english": "Mavie is 27 years old. She is clumsy, beautiful and full of doubts, looking for her path in life. George is 76 years old. He is a lonely and cynic librarianwho doesn't expect a thing from life. The two of them, together, form an unconventional friendship, where love takes on many forms, and changes their parallel divergent ways."
